    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This structural layer uses double-wall corrugated fiberboard, rated for heavy-duty use, to create a rigid external shell. The fluted structure provides excellent compressive strength, preventing the box from collapsing under the weight of other stacked items in the truck.</p>
