    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The final layer involves applying heavy-duty stretch film to seal the entire package. This creates a continuous, airtight, and waterproof barrier that protects the contents from dust, rain, and humidity. Given the potential for variable weather conditions between Chatra and Tori, this weatherproofing is non-negotiable.</p>
