    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the final cost for Packers And Movers Chatra To Tori?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The final price is calculated based on the total distance (approximately 850 km), the volume and weight of household items, any special handling requirements such as fragile glassware or heavy furniture, the type of vehicle (standard container truck versus multi‑car trailer), and applicable GST. IBA‑approved movers also include mandatory insurance and e‑Way bill charges, which are itemised in the transparent tariff breakdown.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my furniture insured during the Chatra‑to‑Tori transit, and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All moves handled by Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that offers 100 % declared‑value protection. The policy safeguards against loss, theft, accidental damage, and exposure to weather elements. A detailed insurance certificate is provided before loading, and any claim is processed within 48 hours of delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 4‑Protocol Zero‑Damage system prevent damage to my household articles?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system starts with a pre‑move inventory audit, followed by custom crating using our 7‑layer packaging, then secure loading with hydraulic ramps and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and finally a post‑delivery inspection with a signed handover report. Each protocol is monitored by our trained crew and verified through live GPS data, ensuring every item reaches Tori intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time while it travels from Chatra to Tori?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every container truck is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive automatic notifications at key milestones—departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival. If any deviation occurs, our emergency response team is alerted instantly to resolve issues.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills for corporate reimbursements?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. As an IBA‑approved mover, we generate GST‑registered invoices that include the mover’s GSTIN, detailed service breakdown, and applicable tax rates. For interstate freight, we also issue an e‑Way bill that complies with the Ministry of Road Transport regulations, making it straightforward for corporate or government reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What types of vehicles are used for moving two‑wheelers and large furniture on the Chatra‑to‑Tori route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We operate a fleet of 120+ specialised container trucks ranging from 18 ft to 32 ft MX units, plus dedicated enclosed multi‑car trailers with hydraulic loading ramps for two‑wheelers. Heavy furniture is loaded onto reinforced container decks with wheel chocks and high‑tensile lashings, ensuring stability throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical household relocation from Chatra to Tori take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit time averages 14‑16 hours of driving, depending on traffic and weather conditions along the National Highway corridors. Including loading, securing, and unloading phases, the complete end‑to‑end process usually spans 2‑3 days. Our 5‑stage workflow ensures each step is efficiently coordinated to meet the promised delivery window.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
